# Mental Mediator API

Environment variable template for local development. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values.

```
# Database Connection Strings
ConnectionStrings__constr=Server=.; Database=MentalMediator; Integrated Security=True; TrustServerCertificate=True;
ConnectionStrings__constr_somee=workstation id=your-database;packet size=4096;
user id=your-user;pwd=your-password;data source=your-database;persist security info=False;
initial catalog=your-db;TrustServerCertificate=True
ConnectionStrings__constr_docker=server=nexus_db;database=nexus;User id=sa;Password=sa;

# JWT Settings
JwtSettings__Issuer=https://your-api-domain.com
JwtSettings__Audience=https://your-frontend-domain.com
JwtSettings__Key=your-jwt-secret-key-here
JwtSettings__Duration=30

# External Login Provider
GoogleAuthentication__Id=your-google-client-id
GoogleAuthentication__Secret=your-google-client-secret

# Email Settings (Google SMTP)
MailSettings__Host=smtp.gmail.com
MailSettings__Port=587
MailSettings__Username=your-email@gmail.com
MailSettings__Password=your-gmail-app-password

# News API
NewsApi__Address=https://newsapi.org/v2/
NewsApi__ApiKey=your-news-api-key

# Optional one-time bootstrap administrator. Use a unique email and a strong password.
# AdminSeed__Email=local.admin@example.test
# AdminSeed__Password=replace-with-a-strong-local-secret
# AdminSeed__FirstName=Local
# AdminSeed__LastName=Admin
# AdminSeed__BirthDate=1990-01-01
# AdminSeed__Gender=male

# Optional image uploads (profile photos and post images)
# CLOUDINARY_URL=cloudinary://<api_key>:<api_secret>@<cloud_name>
```

**Note:** The `.env` file is already included in `.gitignore` — never commit it to version control.
